#HELPS
1 ABEBAAL EGG MINE~
Abebaal Egg Mine is a Telvanni holding carved under the isle off Azura's Coast
where enslaved workers harvest kwama eggs throughout damp and winding tunnels.
The mine yields many eggs but offers little wealth beyond its guarded entrance
as harsh demands have driven exhausted workers into revolt.~
